+# ⚠️ Important
+The Drop-in SDK is now in an [inactive status](https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/client-sdk/deprecation-policy/ios/v6/#status-categories). Starting September 1, 2026 the Drop-in SDK will move to a [deprecated status](https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/client-sdk/deprecation-policy/ios/v6/#status-categories) and we will no longer make any updates to this SDK. Processing will be supported for 1 year after the deprecation date, but you should upgrade immediately to avoid any disruption.
+
+Starting September 1, 2027 the Drop-in SDK will move to an [unsupported status](https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/client-sdk/deprecation-policy/ios/v6/#status-categories) and will no longer supported by Braintree developers or Braintree Support. Processing for unsupported SDKs can be suspended at any time.
+
+Please migrate to the [Braintree SDK](https://github.com/braintree/braintree_ios) to continue processing and receiving updates.
+
+----------
+
 Welcome to Braintree's Drop-in SDK for iOS!
 
